        {
          "table": "25041699",
          "sha256": "9045ac31186bf51668a40ef628fa46eb1ec239645f761e17f222981bb6ac8b07",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c2",
      "package": "QuestFindMillerLostWish",
      "field": "phases/1/journal",
      "table": "25001699",
      "key": "2e5c1e52",
      "text_raw": "The Arwic Mines Overseer would like you to help his friend, the Miller of Kehan at 42.5 N, 11.2 E.\n\nThe Arwic Mines Overseer told you, \\qBravo - perhaps I will use this to give those Drudges a good smiting! You've been such a help -- take this, with my thanks! Incidentally, perhaps you could help a friend of mine in Lost Wish? She's been battling the Drudge scourge over in her neck of the wood as well!\\q",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "25001699",
          "sha256": "75182b5e678e800ccc91f18ce721aae63afe452523528d78c5d90019f0538552",
          "installed_record_identical": true
        },
        {
          "table": "25061699",
          "sha256": "14e7f0ae12bfffe06727b5930e5c1c6124b5ecea07f882730463d90ba982b59c",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c7",
      "package": "QuestDrudgeWindmill",
      "field": "name",
      "table": "250016ad",
      "key": "a8607cec",
      "text_raw": "Kehan Windmill Quest[E]",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016ad",
          "sha256": "306872153d9cc33ed60fd8ddf622fb6bbd8938ced5ecf1bcfba993b3a884a05e",
          "installed_record_identical": true
        },
        {
          "table": "250216ad",
          "sha256": "9a40f6e9eec3664b63e36f7c9dacb7d479d73b60d373f76e13b3fa3fc02d132e",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c7",
      "package": "QuestDrudgeWindmill",
      "field": "summary",
      "table": "250016ad",
      "key": "6c459364",
      "text_raw": "\n\nThe Miller of Kehan desperately needs your help in repairing the family windmill to the north of Kehan.\n\n",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016ad",
          "sha256": "306872153d9cc33ed60fd8ddf622fb6bbd8938ced5ecf1bcfba993b3a884a05e",
          "installed_record_identical": true
        },
        {
          "table": "250416ad",
          "sha256": "5e7ee8b622711b606e625a8e109f51166df0d883e49d2b7f287914baab06e816",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c7",
      "package": "QuestDrudgeWindmill",
      "field": "phases/1/journal",
      "table": "250016ad",
      "key": "2e5c1e52",
      "text_raw": "Obtain a pile of Stone for the Miller.\n\nThe Miller of Kehan told you, \\qA roving band of Drudge Outcasts destroyed my Windmill! Could you help me repair it? I need a pile of Stone. Here, follow this map to find a Stone Quarry, then harvest some Stone and bring it to me. (If you need a Rock Hammer, you can make one yourself -- look under 'Starter Tools' in your Toolmaking panel.)\\q",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016ad",
          "sha256": "306872153d9cc33ed60fd8ddf622fb6bbd8938ced5ecf1bcfba993b3a884a05e",
          "installed_record_identical": true
        },
        {
          "table": "250616ad",
          "sha256": "ab4b8124fddc7b556086c058e85a90f36f9d7a120398626375b4859276cf9435",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c7",
      "package": "QuestDrudgeWindmill",
      "field": "phases/2/journal",
      "table": "250016ad",
      "key": "2e5f1e52",
      "text_raw": "Harvest some Stone with a Rock Hammer, then give it to the Miller of Kehan.",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016ad",
          "sha256": "306872153d9cc33ed60fd8ddf622fb6bbd8938ced5ecf1bcfba993b3a884a05e",
          "installed_record_identical": true
        },
        {
          "table": "250816ad",
          "sha256": "2a104eb7aaf24b5893c945f31e8aff97adbb7ef1386285282116e143baf91c90",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c7",
      "package": "QuestDrudgeWindmill",
      "field": "phases/3/journal",
      "table": "250016ad",
      "key": "2e5e1e52",
      "text_raw": "Place the gear in the Windmill to the north of Kehan.\n\nThe Miller of Kehan told you, \\qI will now create a Windmill gear - the Drudges destroyed the old one. Please place it inside the Windmill to repair it!\\q",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016ad",
          "sha256": "306872153d9cc33ed60fd8ddf622fb6bbd8938ced5ecf1bcfba993b3a884a05e",
          "installed_record_identical": true
        },
        {
          "table": "250a16ad",
          "sha256": "fdded4f56129ea956c4a865253471ba5b8cf89e9f61864ecb75f06538c2c193e",
          "installed_record_identical": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "quest": "400000c7",
      "package": "QuestDrudgeWindmill",
      "field": "phases/4/journal",
      "table": "250016ad",
      "key": "2e591e52",
      "text_raw": "Now that you have repaired the Miller of Kehan's family Windmill, she will surely reward you.",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016ad",
          "sha256": "306872153d9cc33ed60fd8ddf622fb6bbd8938ced5ecf1bcfba993b3a884a05e",
