    },
    {
      "quest": "400000cb",
      "package": "QuestFindWarderEsper",
      "field": "phases/1/journal",
      "table": "250016a0",
      "key": "2e5c1e52",
      "text_raw": "The Miller of Kehan believes the Esper Reaches Warder in Millstone at 37.5 N, 19.9 W has news that would interest you.\n\nThe Miller of Kehan told you, \\qThank you for restoring my Windmill. I've heard that these glyphs are the key to unlock the secrets of this region - take this, with my thanks! And now, you should speak with my associate in the Esper Reaches. He's sent word that he might know who's behind all this Drudge activity we've been seeing lately.\\q",
      "records": [
        {
          "table": "250016a0",
